  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_8272.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La noche de este viernes se ha celebrado en la pista polideportiva del barrio del Castillo, en Onda, la tradicional cena popular, a la que han asistido casi 700 personas. La velada se ha cerrado con dos partidas de bingo y verbena con la orquesta Tar&aacute;ntula.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8267.jpg\" alt=\"img_8267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8268.jpg\" alt=\"img_8268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8269.jpg\" alt=\"img_8269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8270.jpg\" alt=\"img_8270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8272.jpg\" alt=\"img_8272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8273.jpg\" alt=\"img_8273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8274.jpg\" alt=\"img_8274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8275.jpg\" alt=\"img_8275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparpopularfestesbarricastell/img_8276.jpg\" alt=\"img_8276\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig